.TH CYAML_TYPE 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cyaml_type \- return the type tag of a node
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cyaml.h>

cyaml_node_type_t cyaml_type(cyaml node);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Return the cyaml_node_type_t tag of node, or CYAML_NULL when node is
NULL.

The enum values are CYAML_NULL, CYAML_BOOL, CYAML_INTEGER,
CYAML_FLOAT, CYAML_STRING, CYAML_LIST, CYAML_DICTIONARY.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
node  DOM node handle, which can be NULL.
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
A cyaml_node_type_t constant.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cyaml_type_str (3)
